  "bios": {
    "oneLiner": "Technology executive and AI strategist. Group CEO of We The Flywheel. Former Global SVP Engineering at Adidas, CIO at Sweetgreen, and President, Technology at Huge.",
    "short": "Thomas Prommer holds 20+ years scaling engineering at Fortune 500 companies. Former Global SVP Engineering at Adidas (1000+ engineers, $9B+ e-commerce, 50 markets), CIO at Sweetgreen, and President, Technology at Huge (IPG). He has directed 1000+ engineers throughout his career. Currently Group CEO of We The Flywheel and publishes independent AI research at prommer.net and ctaio.dev.",
    "full": "Seasoned technology executive with two decades building and scaling engineering at Fortune 500 and high-growth firms. At Adidas, led 1000+ engineers unifying regional teams into a global function supporting $9B+ e-commerce across 50 markets, modernizing platforms and infrastructure. Previously CIO at Sweetgreen, modernizing point-of-sale and launching the digital ordering platform that drives the majority of revenue. Earlier, President, Technology at Huge (IPG), growing the practice from 50 to 500+ engineers across 14 offices, serving Apple, Google, McDonald's, Toyota and Nike. Currently Group CEO of We The Flywheel — a sports media network, AI consultancy and product studio — and an independent AI strategy writer at prommer.net and ctaio.dev."
  },
